---
/** Gauge: a dial on a sheet: two thirds of a ring filled with ink as far as the reading, the figure in the middle and one word under it. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-center" style="width:168px; padding:18px 16px 16px">
  <span class="cover-arc" style="--fill:.72; display:grid; align-content:end; justify-items:center; gap:9px">
    <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-figure cover-bar-strong" style="position:relative; width:40px"></i>
    <i class="cover-bar" style="position:relative; width:32px"></i>
  </span>
</span>
